author_role: Legal Counsel / privacy contact
date: 2025-05-20
jurisdiction: BE
language: en
themes: [T6]
status: active
signed: false
formality: legal_notice
related_questions: [Q06, Q08]
---
# Employee Privacy Notice (May 2025)

Controller: Tectonic Solutions SA/NV. Privacy contact: privacy@tectonic-solutions.be.

## 1. What we process
Identification data, contract and payroll data, working time records, performance data, IT and security logs (VPN, DLP, access logs).

## 2. Why
Execution of the employment contract, legal obligations (social security, working time), legitimate interests (security of our systems, protection of confidential information).

## 3. E-mail and IT monitoring
3.1 Monitoring of electronic communication data complies with **CCT n° 81** and was presented to the works council.
3.2 **The content of an employee's mailbox is only accessed after the employee has been informed**, in the presence of the employee or a person of their choice where possible, for a specific purpose and limited to what is strictly necessary.
3.3 E-mails clearly identified as **private** (e.g. "PRIVÉ", "private", "persoonlijk" in the subject) are not opened.

## 4. Retention
Security logs: 12 months. Personnel file: 5 years after the end of the contract.

## 5. Your rights
You have the right of access (including a copy of your data, e.g. time records and logs relating to you), rectification, erasure, restriction and objection (GDPR art. 15-21). Requests: privacy@tectonic-solutions.be – answer within one month. Complaints: Data Protection Authority (APD/GBA).

