# Leave Policy (2022)

## 1. Annual holidays
Legal holidays plus 10 extra-legal days.

## 2. Parental leave
2.1 Employees who wish to take parental leave submit a request to their manager and HR at least 2 months in advance.
2.2 **Management may refuse or postpone parental leave during peak business periods (March–June and September–November)**, taking into account the needs of the team.
2.3 Part-time parental leave (1/2 or 1/5) is granted only if the manager confirms the organisation of the team allows it.

## 3. Other leave
Small leave according to CP 200 rules.

HR Department, January 2022

